## 7. Test data sources

Build dynamic values in `test-data/factories/` (Faker + `Date.now()`). Keep static invalid payloads in `test-data/*.ts`. Load secrets and base URLs from `process.env`. Centralize repeated strings in enums (e.g. `test-data/routes.ts`).

✅ **Good**

```typescript
import { buildUser } from "../test-data/factories/user.factory";
import { Routes } from "../test-data/routes";

const user = buildUser();
await page.goto(Routes.settings);
```

❌ **Bad**

```typescript
await page.goto("https://app.example.com/settings");
const email = "testuser+static@mail.com";
```

**Why:** Factories and enums keep specs readable; env and route modules avoid drift when environments change.

